+-\x1b[1m DeviceChain - dcctl install - context prod \x1b[m----------------- dcctl v1.12.0 -+
| \x1b[1mCluster choices\x1b[m                                                              |
|                                                                              |
|   Target     ( ) Managed local kind (*) Existing context (from               |
|              --kube-context prod)                                            |
|   Context    prod (Enter to choose another)                                  |
| > Footprint  ( ) Standard (*) \x1b[7mCompact\x1b[m (from --compact)                       |
|              Compact is the small-footprint preset for the cluster and every |
|              instance on it: smaller volumes, lowered JetStream/KV ceilings  |
|              and scheduling requests, no monitoring stack, no cert-manager,  |
|              and no database backups.                                        |
|   Topology   ( ) Single (*) HA (from --ha)                                   |
|                                                                              |
| Each change re-resolves the plan as the command line would, and runs the     |
| read-only checks again for it.                                               |
|                                                                              |
| Preflight: all checks passed.                                                |
|                                                                              |
|   Continue    Advanced    Preflight    Exit                                  |
|                                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| up/down/Space choose - Tab next - Esc back - q exit - ?/F1 help              |
| Ctrl+C exit                                                                  |
